  portrait: {fileID: 9184839968629213206}
  charactersPerSecond: 30
  offer: 'Hello! A lovely day, isn''t it?

    I''m looking for a business partner.

    But
    I only work with the best.

    Show me what you''re capable of.

    Earn 600
    gold in seven days, starting today, and I''ll pay you 200 gold.

    Good luck,
    young doctor!'
